      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_02",
      "hash64": "39248D9414F0BF75",
      "text": "¿Cómo dices? ¡¿Que ya has registrado las 400\\nespecies de Pokémon?![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_03",
      "hash64": "39248C9414F0BDC2",
      "text": "¡Eso significa que has completado la Pokédex!\\n¡Me quito el sombrero ante tal hazaña!\\r\\n¡Eres un auténtico portento![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_04",
      "hash64": "3924879414F0B543",
      "text": "La investigación sobre los Pokémon de Paldea\\navanza a pedir de boca. Y todo gracias a tu\\r\\nmagnífica ayuda, no cabe duda.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_05",
      "hash64": "3924869414F0B390",
      "text": "Compré esto en una tienda un poco extraña,\\npero espero que lo aceptes como regalo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_06",
      "hash64": "3924899414F0B8A9",
      "text": "Me hubiese encantado regalarte algo mejor\\npor tu colaboración, espero que sea suficiente.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_head_01",
      "hash64": "62C3CD1975E3EB59",
      "text": "¿A qué viene este revuelo? ¿Ha sucedido algo?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_e_07",
      "hash64": "3924889414F0B6F6",
      "text": "¡Ah, director Clavel! Mire lo que ha logrado est[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]ea\\nalumn[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
